    {
      "example": "Local",
      "help_en": "The product type. Valid values:\nLocal (default): Redis Community Edition instance (classic architecture) or memory-optimized instance (classic architecture).\nTair_rdb: memory-optimized instance (cloud-native architecture).\nTair_scm: persistent memory-optimized instance.\nTair_essd: disk-optimized instance.\nOnECS: Redis Community Edition instance (cloud-native architecture).\nThe default value is Local. If you want to query cloud disk resources, you must specify the product type that corresponds to the required cloud disk resources",
      "help_zh": "产品类型，取值（默认值为 Local）：\nLocal：Redis开源版实例（经典版）或内存型（经典版）。\nTair_rdb：内存型（云原生版）。\nTair_scm：持久内存型。\nTair_essd：磁盘型。\nOnECS：Redis开源版实例（云原生版）。\n该参数默认值为 Local，如果需要查云盘资源，需要传入所需云盘资源对应的产品类型",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "product_type",
      "options": [
        "--product-type"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ProductType",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "r-bp1zxszhcgatnx****-db-0",
      "help_en": "The data node ID. You can call the https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/473786.html operation to obtain the data node ID. For the obtained data node ID, you must remove the number sign (`#`) and the content that follows it. For example, retain only r-bp10noxlhcoim2****-db-0.\nBefore you specify this parameter, you must also specify the InstanceId parameter, and the instance must use the cluster or read/write splitting architecture",
      "help_zh": "数据节点ID，可调用https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/473786.html获取。对于获取到的数据节点ID，需要去除井号（0）及其后面的内容，例如仅保留r-bp10noxlhcoim2****-db-0。\n传入本参数前，您还需要传入InstanceId参数，且要求实例为集群或读写分离架构",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "node_id",
      "options": [
        "--node-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "NodeId",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "professional",
      "help_en": "The product series. Valid values:\nprofessional: Professional Edition. This edition supports the standalone, primary/secondary, read/write splitting, and cluster architectures, and provides high scalability.\n <props=\"china\">\neconomical: Economical Edition. This edition supports only the primary/secondary architecture and is cost-effective. For more information, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2489678.html.</props>",
      "help_zh": "产品系列，取值如下：\nprofessional：标准版，支持单副本、主备、读写分离、集群四种架构，扩展性强。\n <props=\"china\">\neconomical：仅支持主备架构，具有价格优势，更多信息请参见https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2489678.html。</props>",
